        {
          "text": "Ngaaya majwi aa-Nehemiya mwana wa-Hakaliya. Mumwezi wa-Kisilevi mumwaka wamakumi obile, nindakali muŋanda yabwami yaku­ Susani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
