        {
          "text": "Lino bakandivwiila kuti, Abo basyaala ibakazwa mubuzike, oko kucisi nkubabede bali mumapenzi mapati, balasampaulwa. Abwalo bulambo bwa-Jerusalemu bulimwayidwe, amilyango yamunzi ilipiide mulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
