        },
        {
          "text": "matwi aako aswiilile, meso aako alange, ukamvwe cikombyo cangu ndemulanda wako ncinkomba kubusyu bwako buzuba obuno, isikati amasiku, nkaambo kabalanda bako bana ba-Israyeli. Ndalyaamba zibi zyabana ba-Israyeli nzitwakubisizya, Ambebo aluzubo lwataata twabisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
